OL,3,GNEWSACommunity group's crowdfunded
OL,4,Aminibus stolen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA south London community group has been
OL,7,Fleft without vital transport after a
OL,8,Fminibus bought with public donations
OL,9,Fwas stolen.
OL,11,FThe vehicle, a Peugeot Boxer which
OL,12,Fhelps elderly and isolated people get
OL,13,Fout of their homes and attend
OL,14,Factivities, was taken from Cedars
OL,15,FAvenue in Mitcham at about 23:00 GMT on
OL,16,FThursday.
OL,18,FGrace Solomon, who runs the Positive
OL,19,FNetwork Community Project in Balham,
OL,20,Fsaid staff were "numb" when they
OL,21,Fdiscovered it was missing.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
